    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate separate YouTube Shorts scripts for all the following news articles.\n\nARTICLES:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data.map((article, index) => ({\n  article_number: index + 1,\n  title: article.title,\n  content: article.contentSnippet || article.content,\n  link: article.link,\n  creator: article.creator || article[\"dc:creator\"],\n  published_date: article.pubDate\n}))) }}\n\nReturn one separate script for every article.\n\nReturn valid JSON using this structure:\n\n{\n  \"videos\": [\n    {\n      \"video_title\": \"\",\n      \"hook\": \"\",\n      \"script\": \"\",\n      \"ending\": \"\",\n      \"hashtags\": [\"\", \"\"],\n      \"article_title\": \"\",\n      \"article_link\": \"\",\n      \"creator\": \"\",\n      \"published_date\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a professional YouTube Shorts Script Generator specializing in AI and technology news.\n\nYour task is to generate separate YouTube Shorts scripts for all news articles provided.\n\nRULES:\n\n1. Generate exactly one script for each article.\n2. Never combine multiple articles into one script.\n3. Create an engaging video title and attention-grabbing hook.\n4. Write a conversational script of 30–60 seconds.\n5. Use simple English and short sentences.\n6. Include a call to action.\n7. Generate 4–5 relevant hashtags.\n8. Never invent facts or information.\n9. Preserve the original article title, link, creator and publication date.\n10. Return valid JSON only.\n11. Do not use Markdown or code fences.\n\nReturn all generated scripts inside one JSON object using the exact structure requested by the user."
        }
      },
